{"about_the_game":"You're an insectoid alien fighting over Jupiter\u2019s moon Europa.<br><br>It\u2019ll be a <strong>tough</strong> battle - a test of your strategy, intuition, and perseverance.<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/e3d2fa8576fc353b533c0eebd22c6167.webp?t=1770748032\" width=357 height=25 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/fcd4764610cc1caab4a5b2545e7ecd48.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=188 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/fcd4764610cc1caab4a5b2545e7ecd48.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/fcd4764610cc1caab4a5b2545e7ecd48.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/58415f83107f6611a00060607fbb1cde.avif?t=1770748032\" width=122 height=150 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/54972d15c191278498ac558be1c84ad8.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=254 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/54972d15c191278498ac558be1c84ad8.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/54972d15c191278498ac558be1c84ad8.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your minions <strong>control themselves</strong>, using &quot;fuzzy logic&quot; to pick the best target.<br><br>Your job as the queen is to focus on <strong>strategy</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/f866527073eb96c8d206bf2ca0f5b2aa.webp?t=1770748032\" width=631 height=50 /></span><br><strong>Mutate your eggs</strong> so you can create combat minions - but you only have 4 &quot;egg slots&quot;, so you <strong>must choose</strong>.<br><br>Make sure to spawn <strong>Harvester</strong> bugs to collect <strong>nectar</strong> resources.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/cbe840697904636f96fe1c7c0f2b0ab2.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=144 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/cbe840697904636f96fe1c7c0f2b0ab2.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/cbe840697904636f96fe1c7c0f2b0ab2.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>When</strong> and <strong>what</strong> you choose to <strong>spawn</strong> or <strong>mutate</strong> is a big part of the tactical choice.<br><br>And always <strong>watch the chaos of battle</strong>. Predicting the outcome of a fight can help you decide your next move.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/53a6fabe328de6031457a973e2fc10bb.webp?t=1770748032\" width=550 height=57 /></span><br>In each of the <strong>21 campaign levels</strong>, the enemy Swarm Queen has <strong>a new unit or ability</strong>, which you then <strong>unlock for use in later levels</strong>.<br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/6420fabeb4cd46fbdba8ad1188bbdd59.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=236 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/6420fabeb4cd46fbdba8ad1188bbdd59.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/6420fabeb4cd46fbdba8ad1188bbdd59.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The enemy queen spawns Harvesters, collects nectar, and unlocks units <i>just like you do.</i> <strong>She judges the situation and tries to counter you as best as she can</strong>.<br><br>The enemy\u2019s advantage is that she has a surprise <strong>new unit or ability</strong> in each level. But, she usually only has access to a <i>few</i> other units. <i>(You can view the enemy\u2019s unit list before starting the level or in the \u201cpause\u201d screen in-game.)</i><br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/0bd9b1246549a7d161ae4094338e2620.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=300 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/0bd9b1246549a7d161ae4094338e2620.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/0bd9b1246549a7d161ae4094338e2620.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Completing the campaign unlocks some \u201c<strong>challenge levels</strong>\u201d, which put a twist on normal gameplay.<br><br>You could also try going back and beating levels on <strong>hard mode</strong> (good luck!), or starting a \u201cNew Game Plus\u201d (added in a free update) with extra nectar for both queens.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/caaf82f5d3df424b0f8b7034f2311a93.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=392 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/caaf82f5d3df424b0f8b7034f2311a93.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/caaf82f5d3df424b0f8b7034f2311a93.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/0ef3ff3125a789e35b575ee1313f9833.avif?t=1770748032\" width=158 height=70 /></span><br>In the biggest update yet, version 2.0 includes an <strong>alternate &quot;cartoon&quot; art style</strong>, <strong>Steam achievements</strong>, visible enemy &quot;<strong>emotions</strong>&quot;, an &quot;easy&quot; <strong>difficulty setting</strong>, and <strong>more</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/788c497bb2e892e23293f198ac082a2b.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=466 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/788c497bb2e892e23293f198ac082a2b.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/788c497bb2e892e23293f198ac082a2b.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/baece74f0a3f2196ffc6b2d07e91b3d3.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=136 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/baece74f0a3f2196ffc6b2d07e91b3d3.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/baece74f0a3f2196ffc6b2d07e91b3d3.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Swarm Queen is inspired by <strong>insects</strong>, and classic sci-fi aliens like Xenomorphs, Zerg, and the &quot;Bugs&quot; from Starship Troopers. It's like a war between ant colonies, but <i>in space!</i><br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/128a51def89c5c15a8643c4f501eb0a6.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=390 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/128a51def89c5c15a8643c4f501eb0a6.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/128a51def89c5c15a8643c4f501eb0a6.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/e7233a6ca307cf4c485c1a51b6a571cb.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=90 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/e7233a6ca307cf4c485c1a51b6a571cb.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/e7233a6ca307cf4c485c1a51b6a571cb.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A \u201c100% scientifically accurate\u201d depiction of Jupiter\u2019s moon Europa, <i>including</i> all of the alien life. :)<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/550b4c7481017328bdf466bb34c708ce.webp?t=1770748032\" width=135 height=23 /></span><br>Swarm Queen is a <strong>one-man indie game</strong> from Canadian developer <strong>Helmi Bastami</strong> (it rhymes with &quot;sell me pastrami&quot;), and my first commercial release. I used to be a hobbyist animator and creator of Flash games on <strong>Flyborg dot net</strong>.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"67b6c148e70341c5d6bb88f7744ec558c5fd9133.jpg","localized_name":"Pro-Gaming Master ","name":"Pro-Gaming Master ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/67b6c148e70341c5d6bb88f7744ec558c5fd9133.jpg"},{"icon":"c35c4fcbb8410f75bb145b444a931712c143935c.jpg","localized_name":"Murder! :D","name":"Murder! :D","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/c35c4fcbb8410f75bb145b444a931712c143935c.jpg"},{"icon":"8bbed973f20e66e6ec5e52aa28d35827945609d8.jpg","localized_name":"Mass Murder, Haha! :D","name":"Mass Murder, Haha! :D","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/8bbed973f20e66e6ec5e52aa28d35827945609d8.jpg"},{"icon":"15bfd2951e19419f93ec4d0093e434626a709dd1.jpg","localized_name":"Serious War Crime. Not Funny. :|","name":"Serious War Crime. Not Funny. :|","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/15bfd2951e19419f93ec4d0093e434626a709dd1.jpg"},{"icon":"c2c6afc69bb41469f81b4f6675543710f1ecbc91.jpg","localized_name":"Small Army","name":"Small Army","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/c2c6afc69bb41469f81b4f6675543710f1ecbc91.jpg"},{"icon":"4ab724a05945b3215602d61f7add6c093cb5be83.jpg","localized_name":"That's a Lot of Space Bugs","name":"That's a Lot of Space Bugs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/4ab724a05945b3215602d61f7add6c093cb5be83.jpg"},{"icon":"1685133c2974dfdcd28fa1aa72d80d1b26b0b104.jpg","localized_name":"Actual Swarm","name":"Actual Swarm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/1685133c2974dfdcd28fa1aa72d80d1b26b0b104.jpg"},{"icon":"07cadc05458fecb3341e1accb40957e2f962110c.jpg","localized_name":"Collect 10,000 Nectar","name":"Collect 10,000 Nectar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/07cadc05458fecb3341e1accb40957e2f962110c.jpg"},{"icon":"d9b892eb64db7808170d14fe618cd5ab8d104314.jpg","localized_name":"Collect 100,000 Nectar","name":"Collect 100,000 Nectar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/d9b892eb64db7808170d14fe618cd5ab8d104314.jpg"},{"icon":"69453a0dc7c1f239c75d41541effe0dc3c42a5b4.jpg","localized_name":"Collect 1,000,000 Nectar","name":"Collect 1,000,000 Nectar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/69453a0dc7c1f239c75d41541effe0dc3c42a5b4.jpg"}],"total":55},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/701870?t=1770748032","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770748032","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/4bfc9ade66a8dae8d6a6c6afd712f688bf4726c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770748032","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/4bfc9ade66a8dae8d6a6c6afd712f688bf4726c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770748032","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"You're an insectoid alien fighting over Jupiter\u2019s moon Europa.<br><br>It\u2019ll be a <strong>tough</strong> battle - a test of your strategy, intuition, and perseverance.<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/e3d2fa8576fc353b533c0eebd22c6167.webp?t=1770748032\" width=357 height=25 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/fcd4764610cc1caab4a5b2545e7ecd48.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=188 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/fcd4764610cc1caab4a5b2545e7ecd48.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/fcd4764610cc1caab4a5b2545e7ecd48.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/58415f83107f6611a00060607fbb1cde.avif?t=1770748032\" width=122 height=150 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/54972d15c191278498ac558be1c84ad8.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=254 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/54972d15c191278498ac558be1c84ad8.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/54972d15c191278498ac558be1c84ad8.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your minions <strong>control themselves</strong>, using &quot;fuzzy logic&quot; to pick the best target.<br><br>Your job as the queen is to focus on <strong>strategy</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/f866527073eb96c8d206bf2ca0f5b2aa.webp?t=1770748032\" width=631 height=50 /></span><br><strong>Mutate your eggs</strong> so you can create combat minions - but you only have 4 &quot;egg slots&quot;, so you <strong>must choose</strong>.<br><br>Make sure to spawn <strong>Harvester</strong> bugs to collect <strong>nectar</strong> resources.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/cbe840697904636f96fe1c7c0f2b0ab2.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=144 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/cbe840697904636f96fe1c7c0f2b0ab2.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/cbe840697904636f96fe1c7c0f2b0ab2.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>When</strong> and <strong>what</strong> you choose to <strong>spawn</strong> or <strong>mutate</strong> is a big part of the tactical choice.<br><br>And always <strong>watch the chaos of battle</strong>. Predicting the outcome of a fight can help you decide your next move.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/53a6fabe328de6031457a973e2fc10bb.webp?t=1770748032\" width=550 height=57 /></span><br>In each of the <strong>21 campaign levels</strong>, the enemy Swarm Queen has <strong>a new unit or ability</strong>, which you then <strong>unlock for use in later levels</strong>.<br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/6420fabeb4cd46fbdba8ad1188bbdd59.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=236 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/6420fabeb4cd46fbdba8ad1188bbdd59.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/6420fabeb4cd46fbdba8ad1188bbdd59.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The enemy queen spawns Harvesters, collects nectar, and unlocks units <i>just like you do.</i> <strong>She judges the situation and tries to counter you as best as she can</strong>.<br><br>The enemy\u2019s advantage is that she has a surprise <strong>new unit or ability</strong> in each level. But, she usually only has access to a <i>few</i> other units. <i>(You can view the enemy\u2019s unit list before starting the level or in the \u201cpause\u201d screen in-game.)</i><br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/0bd9b1246549a7d161ae4094338e2620.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=300 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/0bd9b1246549a7d161ae4094338e2620.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/0bd9b1246549a7d161ae4094338e2620.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Completing the campaign unlocks some \u201c<strong>challenge levels</strong>\u201d, which put a twist on normal gameplay.<br><br>You could also try going back and beating levels on <strong>hard mode</strong> (good luck!), or starting a \u201cNew Game Plus\u201d (added in a free update) with extra nectar for both queens.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/caaf82f5d3df424b0f8b7034f2311a93.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=392 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/caaf82f5d3df424b0f8b7034f2311a93.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/caaf82f5d3df424b0f8b7034f2311a93.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/0ef3ff3125a789e35b575ee1313f9833.avif?t=1770748032\" width=158 height=70 /></span><br>In the biggest update yet, version 2.0 includes an <strong>alternate &quot;cartoon&quot; art style</strong>, <strong>Steam achievements</strong>, visible enemy &quot;<strong>emotions</strong>&quot;, an &quot;easy&quot; <strong>difficulty setting</strong>, and <strong>more</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/788c497bb2e892e23293f198ac082a2b.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=466 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/788c497bb2e892e23293f198ac082a2b.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/788c497bb2e892e23293f198ac082a2b.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/baece74f0a3f2196ffc6b2d07e91b3d3.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=136 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/baece74f0a3f2196ffc6b2d07e91b3d3.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/baece74f0a3f2196ffc6b2d07e91b3d3.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Swarm Queen is inspired by <strong>insects</strong>, and classic sci-fi aliens like Xenomorphs, Zerg, and the &quot;Bugs&quot; from Starship Troopers. It's like a war between ant colonies, but <i>in space!</i><br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/128a51def89c5c15a8643c4f501eb0a6.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=390 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/128a51def89c5c15a8643c4f501eb0a6.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/128a51def89c5c15a8643c4f501eb0a6.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/e7233a6ca307cf4c485c1a51b6a571cb.poster.avif?t=1770748032\" width=90 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/e7233a6ca307cf4c485c1a51b6a571cb.webm?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/e7233a6ca307cf4c485c1a51b6a571cb.mp4?t=1770748032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A \u201c100% scientifically accurate\u201d depiction of Jupiter\u2019s moon Europa, <i>including</i> all of the alien life. :)<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/550b4c7481017328bdf466bb34c708ce.webp?t=1770748032\" width=135 height=23 /></span><br>Swarm Queen is a <strong>one-man indie game</strong> from Canadian developer <strong>Helmi Bastami</strong> (it rhymes with &quot;sell me pastrami&quot;), and my first commercial release. I used to be a hobbyist animator and creator of Flash games on <strong>Flyborg dot net</strong>.","developers":["Helmi Bastami"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/b559b6ac80ef01c2ad39c69f6c6eedfe51e8fad5/header.jpg?t=1770748032","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/701870/464692/65afbacd86d731fcd845bffcf4c69b09d8a11493/1751133356/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745894047","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/701870/464692/65afbacd86d731fcd845bffcf4c69b09d8a11493/1751133356/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745894047","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/701870/464692/65afbacd86d731fcd845bffcf4c69b09d8a11493/1751133356/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1745894047","id":256887512,"name":"Swarm Queen - Latest Update Trailer (English)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256887512/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1745894047"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/701870/505036/e2d9a5524ac26216ef2cf17f546f18101a6ce64a/1751133365/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745855793","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/701870/505036/e2d9a